# Frontend Rules

Use React with TypeScript.
Frontend must not call OpenAI directly.
Frontend only calls backend APIs.

Main components:
- UploadBox
- PdfViewerPanel
- AnalysisPanel
- RiskScoreCard
- ClauseCard
- RiskFindingCard
- ChatPanel
- LoadingSpinner

Keep UI clean and demo-ready.
Do not overbuild dashboard before MVP works.
